---
const tiers = ['All off', 'Drafted for review', 'Fully autonomous'];
---

<section id="your-control" class="pt-5 pb-8 px-6 bg-paper-1 text-on-paper">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-5" data-reveal>Your control</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading text-on-paper max-w-2xl text-[clamp(1.875rem,3vw+1rem,2.75rem)]" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms">
      You decide how much your AI handles.
    </h2>
    <p class="section-lede text-on-paper-soft text-lg max-w-2xl text-balance" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms">
      Client chat runs at the level you pick: All off, Drafted for review, or Fully autonomous. Drafted for review is the default, and some clients always stay on review even when you pick Fully autonomous. Program changes never apply without your approval. Change it any time.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:210ms">
      {tiers.map((tier) => (
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-paper-2 border border-hairline-light font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-on-paper-soft">
          {tier}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
